    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source ICF b1402 SNOMED CT 311519004 = divided attention: attending to two or more stimuli/tasks
        simultaneously. Target (Athena 4205822) =, active standard. Exact 1:1 equivalence: ICF and
        SNOMED CT denote the same mental function, confirmed by direct concept-name match in both mirrors.
        Exact-equivalent tier.
        """
}
