mapping "b1443.1" source="b1443" target="SNOMED_CT:69262000" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source ICF b1443 SNOMED CT 69262000 = working memory: the limited-capacity system for temporarily
        holding and manipulating information over seconds (distinct from short-term memory in its
        manipulation component). SNOMED CT has no dedicated function concept. Target (Athena 4239348) =,
