mapping "b147.1" source="b147" target="SNOMED_CT:404952007" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source ICF b147 SNOMED CT 404952007 = psychomotor functions: the mental functions of control and
        coordination of motor and psychological behavior (covering psychomotor control b1470 and
        psychomotor quality b1471). SNOMED CT has no observable entity; the closest standard concept is
