        psychomotor functioning. Low tier : the target covers one aspect (energy) of the broader
        psychomotor-functions source and is the only function-level psychomotor observable in SNOMED CT;
        the control and quality axes are absent, so this is a defensible-but-imperfect broader link
        rather than an equivalence.
        """
}
